	(text "SERIAL CLOCK: X2 1.8432 MHz oscillator -> SER_CLK_SRC -> U19 inverter (AddressDecode) -> SER_CLK (ACIA);\n  RN7D 33R -> slot pin 15 (SER_CLK_BUS).\nBUS CLOCK: X1 14.31818 MHz oscillator -> OSC14 -> U19 inverter -> HS_CLK_SRC -> U88 bus clock generator;\n  RN7E 33R -> slot HS_CLK. U88 also makes the CPU phi0 (P_PHI0): PHI2 held low while DMAB_S is low."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 149.86 158.75 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "a36af087-3dcd-4c11-9a20-cbcdb34b9858")
	)
	(text "BUS CLOCK (U88, GAL C): 14.318 MHz master -> PHI2 / PHI1 / SND_CLK (3.58 MHz)\nJ36 1-2: 7.16 MHz (W65C22S / W65C51N)    J36 2-3: 3.58 MHz (Rockwell R65C22 / R65C51, P4 grade)\nSlow regions get +1 PHI2-low period and +0..3 PHI2-high periods (register $FFF5, GAL D)"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 96.52 50.8 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
